# Build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (see the note at the top of the Dockerfile):
# the Dockerfile and docker/entrypoint.sh live here, and a Dockerfile cannot COPY from
# outside its context. Everything the image needs is under app/, so everything else is
# kept out of the context — the shorter the context, the smaller the chance of shipping
# something by accident.
app/node_modules
app/test
app/openwebui
data
.env
.env.*
.git
**/__pycache__
*.log
